Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:57:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Legendary items show as "L-<name>" with their powers in the
 client tooltip

Legendary items are sent to the client with a display item ID whose client entry is
named "L-<name>" and describes its powers. tools/make_legendary_client.py generates
those entries (plus the legendary materials) from a client's own data files.
Forging now refreshes the item on the client right away.

